{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2016-10", "window": 4, "start_date": 1477267200, "end_date": 1477958399, "month_true_total": 69, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 01:01:03 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "26335850", "author": {"steamid": "76561198021449575", "personaname": "felipe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/felipeaffonso/", "num_games_owned": 274, "num_reviews": 264, "playtime_forever": 61, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 61, "last_played": 1477705194, "avatar": "c24902b61044f1ce302fe5feac5f1395c1d7be2c"}, "language": "english", "review": "simple game but very fun, I recommend to be played in multiplayer.\n\ncontrols work well, graphics are ok and most importantly the gameplay is fun\n\n\njogo simples porém muito divertido, recomendo que seja jogado em multiplayer.\n\nos controles funcionam bem, graficos são ok e o mais importante o gameplay é divertido", "timestamp_created": 1477919991, "timestamp_updated": 1477919991, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26316490", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072320028", "personaname": "TheFancyRoman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TheFancyRoman/", "num_games_owned": 310, "num_reviews": 103, "playtime_forever": 255, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 255, "last_played": 1473004038, "avatar": "8330ba60174f5772cc3481b7513d3b27d057ddeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Alien Swarm is a fun free alien game. It's basicly like Halo: Spartan Assualt but with zombies and you know, a reason to play it. And that reason is: It is fun. It has challenge in it, something Spartan Assault lacked. Alien Swarm can either be really really easy or really really hard. Or something in between. The story is basicly you and your crew trying to get out of a alien-infested facility.\n\nIt's nothing special, it is a good game, don't get me wrong but... it a basic game. It is free, so that gives it a huge bonus. I would not pay for this game, it isn't that great, but for what it is, it is pretty cool.", "timestamp_created": 1477836971, "timestamp_updated": 1477836971, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26299282", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970917684", "personaname": "Graithen", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/graithen/", "num_games_owned": 631, "num_reviews": 115, "playtime_forever": 716, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 600, "last_played": 1480179678, "avatar": "a9bde3c70cf1b7f3b9e9385aee7c19cf81f953ca"}, "language": "english", "review": "For free, this game is a hidden gem from Valve. It is both tense and exciting, and watching all your teamwork unravel in the face of a swarm of aliens is definately a highlight.", "timestamp_created": 1477769990, "timestamp_updated": 1477769990, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.607840478420257568", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26298054", "author": {"steamid": "76561198313275275", "personaname": "Saber", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TotallySaber/", "num_games_owned": 149, "num_reviews": 24,